Your personal recipe book and calorie counter:
- Add recipe categories; 
- Any number of your recipes; 
- Specify calories to each dish; 
- All your recipes are always at your fingertips; 
- Choose each day what to eat or cook; 
- Keep a daily calorie count; 
- Create and keep a record of food from restaurants;
- Keep track of any beverage.

This is your personal notebook of all your recipes, add recipes, categories and keep a record of what meals you ate today or yesterday and how many calories were eaten. Choose what to cook for tomorrow or what to order in a restaurant. 

Create your own personal categories, recipes, record the calorie count of each recipe and calculate calories per 1 serving. Keep a record every day, conveniently select recipes. You can add dishes from restaurants and fast food. Keep a record of any beverages.

We’re Dodo Pizza. We’re in love with two things: Pizza and Tech. So, we’ve found a way to make the best pizza, make it affordable, and deliver fast.

All our pizzas have crunchy dough, we use fresh vegetables, creamy mozzarella, and a special sauce made from Italian tomatoes and spices. We are fans of quality, cleanliness, and safety and we have nothing to hide!

You can:

— combine pizza halves;

— tailor the recipe according to your preference;

— store the order history and delivery addresses;

— collect a cashback for each order.

Our first pizzeria opened in 2011, now we have over 950 stores in 18 countries such as Vietnam, Nigeria, the United Arab Emirates, Estonia, and a host of other countries. Try us! Download the App and order now.

Please send your suggestions and questions to mobile@dodopizza.com
